---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Prose title="Advertising disclosure" description={`How ${SITE.name} is funded: ads and affiliate links, kept separate from our guides.`} path="advertising-disclosure/" updated="10 November 2026">
  <p>{SITE.name} is free to read. To pay for it, we may show ads and use affiliate links.</p>
  <h2>Ads</h2>
  <p>Ads are served by Google AdSense and other ad networks. They are clearly separate from guide content. We do not choose individual ads, and an ad on a page is not an endorsement.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Some links to services, such as money transfer apps, travel SIMs or hotel bookings, are affiliate links. If you sign up or buy through them we may earn a commission, at no extra cost to you. Affiliate links are marked on the page.</p>
  <h2>Sponsored content</h2>
  <p>Any sponsored article is labelled "Sponsored" at the top. Sponsors never change the steps, fees or rules in our guides.</p>
</Prose>
